      "text": "- Monolithic architecture :- Simple in nature\n       - Single project doing a lot of responsibility\n       - Code reusability is the advantage of this architecture\n       - When code grows and executables becomes very heavy\n\n                 - Builds -> time consuming\n                 - Tests -> time consuming\n                 - Running and loading the excecutables -> time consuming\n  ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Monolithic architecture :- Simple in nature\n       - Single project doing a lot of responsibility\n       - Code reusability is the advantage of this architecture\n       - When code grows and executables becomes very heavy\n\n                 - Builds -> time consuming\n                 - Tests -> time consuming\n                 - Running and loading the excecutables -> time consuming\n  ",
      "autoResize": true,
