      "text": "- Ratio: amount of products visits vs amount of products buyed -> 1:10\n        that means in a software two kinds of loads that are read or write \n        may different in quantum\n- mutation in orders -> write operations\n- mutation :- delete, create, update, insert -> category of operations which changes data\n- query :- read -> category of operations which reads data\n\n",
