      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "# Index selectivity:\n    - Ratio of numebr of distinct values to the number of total rows. \n    - it is a measure of how uniquely a column (or a combination of cols) identifies rows in a table.\n    \n    selectivity = number of distinct values / total number of rows\n   - ans lies in the range [0,1]\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "# Index selectivity:\n    - Ratio of numebr of distinct values to the number of total rows. \n    - it is a measure of how uniquely a column (or a combination of cols) identifies rows in a table.\n    \n    selectivity = number of distinct values / total number of rows\n   - ans lies in the range [0,1]\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xeHqRJJzgby5sphOQ9Ukc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -147.76025390625,
      "y": 5501.099933624268,
      "width": 754.8195190429688,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
